================================================================================
Go module dependencies
================================================================================

Explorer is built from, and its binary statically links, the Go modules
pinned in go.mod and go.sum — chiefly the AWS SDK for Go v2 (Apache-2.0),
modernc.org/sqlite and its runtime (BSD-3-Clause), and golang.org/x/net and
golang.org/x/text (BSD-3-Clause), plus their transitive dependencies. Each is
used under its own license. `go mod download -json` lists the exact versions,
and each module's license file ships in the module cache.
